    "title": "Oxford man arrested at Taco Bell after methamphetamine found in pickup - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jordyn Pennington ,\n10 hours ago An Oxford man was arrested on drug charges after being pulled over at Taco Bell with methamphetamine in his truck. A deputy observed 50-year-old Jeremy Scott Morgan driving a grey Dodge pickup truck westbound on State Road 44 near the intersection of Interstate 75 in Wildwood around 12:20 a.m. Saturday, according to an arrest report from the Sumter County Sheriff’s Office. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
